    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17706" root="زرم" body-key="z">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازرمهُ</span></b>  <i>He,</i> or <i>it, interrupted it, stopped it,</i>
or <i>caused it to cease;</i> namely, one's urine, and
his flow of tears, and his speech; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرَمَهُ</span></b> ,
aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرِمَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرْمٌ</span>; (TA;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زرّمهُ</span></b> , (K,)
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَزْرِيمٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>He interrupted,</i> or
<i>stopped, his</i> (another's) <i>urine.</i> (As, S, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَزْرَمَتْ</span> <i>She</i> (a camel) <i>interrupted her flow of
urine by little and little.</i> (AA, TA.)

